Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day! Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you were just a little boy when I saw you back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen you several times over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never bothered to call out to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't visited your home for many,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,many years before your parents were murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've thought about you all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I knew your father pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And your mother too, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we can meet down at the Bottom Bar and talk about old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll just finish sweeping here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a little walk and I'll see you at the Bottom Bar later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
